      {
        "path": "internal/handler/webhook.go",
        "line": 74,
        "body": "🟢 **Nit** — `log.Info()` here was `log.Warn()` in the original `main.go`. An unregistered repo webhook could indicate misconfiguration; `Warn` conveys that more clearly."
      }
    ]
  }'

